    <bpmn:process id="W_W4442" name="W4442. Customer SCO Transaction Processing &amp; Assistance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer at SCO
Frequency: Continuous (a share of 2.8M monthly transactions)
Volume: SCO share grows with rollout (target 20–40% of baskets)
Owner: SCO Attendant / Frontend (VS-08)
Participants: Attendants, Frontend (VS-08), Cashiers, Store Ops (VS-07), Loyalty (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4442 — Customer SCO Transaction Processing &amp; Assistance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4442_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4442_Lane1" name="SCO Attendant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4442_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4442_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4442_Lane2" name="SCO Terminal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4442_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4442_Lane3" name="Attendant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4442_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4442_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4442_Start5" name="Customer at SCO">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4442_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4442_Task6" name="Customer scans/bags/pays at SCO; attendant monitors pod, proactively assists…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer scans/bags/pays at SCO; attendant monitors pod, proactively assists first-timers/seniors/PWD, and intervenes on flags (W4443)
Responsible (R): SCO Attendant
Accountable (A): Frontend Supervisor
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4442_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4442_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4442_Task7" name="SCO processes tender (cash/card/e-wallet/loyalty), applies price/promo/loyalty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: SCO processes tender (cash/card/e-wallet/loyalty), applies price/promo/loyalty real-time, issues BIR-compliant receipt/e-invoice (VS-79), and syncs inventory (VS-08)
Responsible (R): SCO Terminal / POS-ERP
Accountable (A): Frontend Supervisor
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4442_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4442_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4442_Task8" name="Attendant handles exceptions (price dispute, system error, intervention), keeps…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Attendant handles exceptions (price dispute, system error, intervention), keeps the pod flowing, and escalates complex cases (W4450)
Responsible (R): Attendant / Frontend
Accountable (A): Frontend Supervisor
Duration: Per exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4442_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4442_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4442_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4442_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-678 (ensure controlled execution — SCO &amp; Scan-&amp;-Go Daily Operations &amp; Customer Experience (PA-149.2).) | - CTL-678: tender/price/promo/loyalty correct; BIR-compliant receipt/e-invoice; inventory synced; exceptions managed
Owner: SCO Attendant / Frontend (VS-08)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4442_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4442_Annotation10" targetRef="W4442_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
