Owner: IT Service Desk (VS-27.1) / Frontend (VS-08) / IFM (VS-138)
Participants: IT Service Desk (VS-27.1), Frontend (VS-08), IFM (VS-138), Vendor (VS-34), Store Ops (VS-07)
