        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Vendor/IFM triage &amp; resolve — software reset/patch, hardware swap, calibration (VS-115), recycler service — within SLA (uptime target)
Responsible (R): IT / Vendor / IFM
Accountable (A): IT Service Lead / IFM Lead
Duration: Per SLA</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4446_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4446_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
